    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Night of Alighnment</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Angella has come to accept that 'The Devil's Rising' isn't an event that needs to be feared, even if it's the one night of the year that Dark Magic is it's most powerful. For others, it's an important day of remembrance of magic and for others... It's a means of survival. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In a bid to try and understand Shadow Weaver's personal tradition, our trio of milfs discovers that things aren't always as they seem.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
